SUMMARY:Day 18: 阿卡罗阿半日游 & 基督城
DESCRIPTION:【驾车路线: 基督城 -> 阿卡罗阿 (超20km分段)】\nChristchurch CBD -> Tai Tapu(~20km) -> Little River(~15km) -> Hilltop Tavern(~20km) -> Akaroa(~25km)\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Christchurch+Central+City,+New+Zealand/Tai+Tapu,+New+Zealand/Little+River,+New+Zealand/Hilltop+Tavern,+New+Zealand/Akaroa,+New+Zealand\n\n【驾车路线: 阿卡罗阿 -> 基督城市区 -> 机场】\nAkaroa -> Christchurch Botanic Gardens(~80km) -> Cathedral Square -> Christchurch Airport\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Akaroa,+New+Zealand/Christchurch+Botanic+Gardens,+New+Zealand/Cathedral+Square,+Christchurch,+New+Zealand/Christchurch+Airport,+New+Zealand\n
END:VEVENT
