SUMMARY:Day 19: 飞抵布里斯班 & 黄金海岸自然日
DESCRIPTION:【驾车路线: 布里斯班机场 -> 黄金海岸 -> Springbrook (超20km分段)】\nBrisbane Airport -> Springwood(~35km) -> Coomera(~35km) -> Broadbeach(~25km) -> Mudgeeraba(~15km) -> Natural Bridge(~25km) -> Best Of All Lookout(~15km) -> Purling Brook Falls(~15km) -> Burleigh Heads(~35km)\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Brisbane+Airport,+QLD/Springwood,+QLD/Coomera,+QLD/Broadbeach,+QLD/Mudgeeraba,+QLD/Natural+Bridge,+Springbrook,+QLD/Best+Of+All+Lookout,+QLD/Purling+Brook+Falls,+QLD/Burleigh+Heads,+QLD\n
