SUMMARY:Day 20: 黄金海岸 海滩城市日
DESCRIPTION:【驾车路线: 黄金海岸海滩 (近距离)】\nBurleigh Head National Park -> Surfers Paradise Beach -> SkyPoint Observation Deck -> Snapper Rocks, Coolangatta -> Kirra Beach -> Broadbeach\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Burleigh+Head+National+Park,+QLD/Surfers+Paradise+Beach,+QLD/SkyPoint+Observation+Deck,+QLD/Snapper+Rocks,+Coolangatta,+QLD/Kirra+Beach,+QLD/Broadbeach,+QLD\n
