SUMMARY:Day 21: Lone Pine 考拉 & 布里斯班
DESCRIPTION:【驾车路线: 黄金海岸 -> Lone Pine -> 布里斯班机场 (超20km分段)】\nBroadbeach -> Coomera(~30km) -> Springwood(~35km) -> Lone Pine Koala Sanctuary(~25km) -> Brisbane Airport(~25km)\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Broadbeach,+QLD/Coomera,+QLD/Springwood,+QLD/Lone+Pine+Koala+Sanctuary,+QLD/Brisbane+Airport,+QLD\n\n【市区交通路线: 布里斯班市区】\nBrisbane Airport -> South Bank Parklands -> Story Bridge -> Mt Coot-tha Lookout -> Eat Street Northshore\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Brisbane+Airport,+QLD/South+Bank+Parklands,+QLD/Story+Bridge,+Brisbane,+QLD/Mt+Coot-tha+Lookout,+QLD/Eat+Street+Northshore,+QLD\n
